#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:5
#: 36fe60d784644ad5816513f8f254c969 8a09b60c5d834a64834ad368321f177b
#: 8ec76655805e4d1e83e5af2dc8721548 90869f83717c4907a0418629ed89f4ac
#: b5c677f7fdf6402db4fc341488b9ec32
msgid "Multi-Vehicle Flying"
msgstr "多飞行器飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:7
#: a5ee6bf39f4d4581952e0ed69d282a49 ad64727d300f44eea84c17b264cfdf3f
#: ad6e8f2673414407b45e1fd630da69a1 b6e771573f6c4d01afe14e1755cb0718
#: c9d98050aede4c7c91ee3104bd6b36e5
msgid ""
"This page shows how to monitor and control multiple vehicles using a single "
"ground station. Although this capability has been demonstrated (see video "
"below) it is somewhat `experimental "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/multi-vehicle-testing-with-apm-copter-"
"tracker-and-mission-planner>`__."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍如何使用单个地面站监控和控制多台飞行器。尽管此功能已得到演示（见下方视频），但仍属于 `实验性功能 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/multi-vehicle-testing-with-apm-copter-"
"tracker-and-mission-planner>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:14
#: 112d37e349d841a1918995c823fd3442
msgid ""
"This example has been greatly surpassed by `Michael Clement's 50 plane "
"demonstration <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/from-zero-to-fifty-"
"planes-in-twenty-seven-minutes>`__\\"
msgstr ""
"本示例已被 `Michael Clement 的 50 架飞机演示 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/from-zero-to-fifty-planes-in-twenty-"
"seven-minutes>`__\\ 大幅超越"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:20
#: 105f232ef13143a3be18d548652be717 36f285d40e8a41aabae5c009a7146c47
#: 370da1cc78c04028900fefc7ec0e8a97 734de769850e4421aa76e29ae891e00f
#: b9ac70b358ed4810afb81f86b47aea49
msgid "Equipment you will need"
msgstr "所需设备"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:22
#: 5801188c5a254574b386c6cdd038af73 613dbafc4306438a8d9858c74ecb4d78
#: c503d4f42de7478481645ac6b271ab4c c5ef38990fd9425b95bab2c6438b4758
#: f939396854c04b15a33194d9e70ae40f
msgid ""
"Multiple `Planes <https://ardupilot.org/plane/index.html>`_ or :ref:`Copters"
" <copter:home>` or :ref:`Rovers <rover:home>`"
msgstr ""
"多架 `固定翼 <https://ardupilot.org/plane/index.html>`_ 或 :ref:`多旋翼 "
"<copter:home>` 或 :ref:`无人车 <rover:home>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:25
#: 88929bbcb4cc4464bc9e85a053ee8a10 8a26d5138b794cf486a383be5d14ef69
#: b3016c7fbc5b4b578b134ea473049d76 df65c8f6f26e4ebb9c96e360e8a95ef3
#: fc8a0cba025146f39633940a475cd660
msgid ""
"An :ref:`Antenna Tracker <antennatracker:home>`\\ (a.k.a. Tracker) to "
"combine the telemetry data from vehicles and send to the GCS."
msgstr ""
":ref:`天线追踪器 <antennatracker:home>`\\（简称 Tracker），用于合并来自各飞行器的数传数据并发送到 GCS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:27
#: 4036eb2a73194d7587e3745dbd8a24a0 579a01d9161441d19619d4bbeb688772
#: 5b86c706e7aa47d793c10ebc85f6a9ee 843db34ce14a41718143359a9edfdae6
#: c306835fb9a341faaa9d03b6b4ed359b
msgid ""
"Pairs of\\ :ref:`telemetry radios <common-telemetry-landingpage>` for each "
"vehicle (i.e. 2x number of vehicles) OR multi-point radios (like the "
":ref:`RFD900 <common-rfd900>`) in which case just 1 radio for each vehicle +"
" 1 for the ground station."
msgstr ""
"每台飞行器一对 :ref:`数传模块 <common-telemetry-landingpage>` （即飞行器数量的 2 倍），或多点数传（如 "
":ref:`RFD900 <common-rfd900>`），此时每台飞行器只需 1 个数传模块加 1 个地面站模块。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:31
#: 0b886a614a234e53b5fb0fb7b304eef1 42ebf836e7f249809b112f0a92794624
#: 4a9e68c9c8d34481a9c3485611eb1ae2 de788e324aa14ee2b55264fea42069b8
#: e52e03e2af934ab088a7d391ca3a53c7
msgid ""
"GCS capable of displaying/controlling multiple vehicles (i.e. the "
":ref:`Mission Planner <planner:home>`)."
msgstr "能够显示/控制多台飞行器的 GCS（即 :ref:`Mission Planner <planner:home>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:33
#: 1708dd85db6f4c4ebccdabaed2c5cc78 4e7729b1b4da4e52b29d806b692d8381
#: ae1b75cfa9244cdeb3388f0793519340 d7d6739a99154135b8cf985e46e21137
#: dc5ed502d16549b6996f509cd5bef415
msgid "RC transmitter for each vehicle (optional)."
msgstr "每台飞行器的遥控器（可选）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:36
#: 55c7832bbdd14c37a410d7bdd1831887 8c57a3271b1142a7b3925963bf43c885
#: aeac5d4dad1744f59c6e4d70fddf8f72 afc4b138cb5c482481c90f69022b10fa
#: b4307dc08e8c45989cd1015244671437
msgid "Pre-Flight Setup"
msgstr "飞前配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:38
#: 2e5ed78b094c44baa2b9c2c5e578abed 3637fd081d854100a3006a566a4c7bc0
#: 3a44a5aa89c64f67a9b6ac62ed140a00 6c95cb0632b849eba9aa02852a30a605
#: db526ead13144a868e1deb9c8a9dc4bf
msgid ""
"If using SiK radios, :ref:`set the NetID <common-sik-telemetry-"
"radio_configuring_using_the_mission_planner>` of each pair of radios to a "
"unique number.  I.e. if controlling 3 vehicles, set the ``NetID`` of one "
"pair to \"23\", the 2nd pair to \"24\", the 3rd pair to \"25\"."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 SiK 数传，:ref:`设置每对数传模块的 NetID <common-sik-telemetry-"
"radio_configuring_using_the_mission_planner>`，确保每对唯一。例如控制 3 台飞行器时，第一对 "
"``NetID`` 设为「23」，第二对设为「24」，第三对设为「25」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:42
#: 7dc2892b08be45fb98f5a595bbda50f2 8d1823b27bb746cfb03e33af79b7a64c
#: eea809b7c23e4c1cb94270c0e5aff400 ef3ea0ec34a840deb8fc4d67123f6d20
#: f0921c2471de4ce99dd68ce84374df82
msgid ""
"Connect one of each radio pairs to the vehicle autopilots (i.e. Pixhawk) "
"using Telem1 or Telem2."
msgstr "将每对数传模块中的一个连接到飞行器飞控（如 Pixhawk）的 Telem1 或 Telem2 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:44
#: 21e3834717ff4e01afeada17a1ac8bff 351f42728a3547cc8a758b95a964fc4e
#: 35c15e1c4fe043a1886554d1023eaa14 9b9f9c2ac13d4dfa9eea9b5975b7a061
#: a5526dd4d32c4ac4a114a18d53f3761b
msgid ""
"Connect the other pairs to the Tracker's controller (i.e. Pixhawk) using "
"Telem1, Telem2 and Serial 4/5 ports."
msgstr "将另外几个连接到 Tracker 控制器（如 Pixhawk）的 Telem1、Telem2 和 Serial 4/5 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:46
#: 17988370600a4a78a915d3282e3e3f14 4e70db8dd32f4e16ba386faaffa5f050
#: 84051f3c88e14d209c94337ee343e80d 90f3c79a9cb74437910016697e26566b
#: e1bc6ce0361048918a99a98b0395c900
msgid ""
"If using Serial 4/5 set the Tracker's ``SERIAL4_PROTOCOL`` to \"1\" to "
"enable MAVLink communication on that port."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 Serial 4/5，将 Tracker 的 ``SERIAL4_PROTOCOL`` 设为「1」以在该端口启用 MAVLink 通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:48
#: 151bb9e1f86f45cda99a66bff1560117 19f1802242724ffca060a0d92f09a50f
#: 538c435d3ea242e3879a08dab279f432 68d6252fa2164fcea1cfb614ca43798e
#: b2992932a96743b8973642a56b9af86d
msgid ""
"Connect to each vehicle's autopilot and the tracker and set the "
"``SYSID_THISMAV`` to a unique number (i.e. \"1\" for first vehicle, \"2\" "
"for second vehicle, \"3\" for third, \"9\" for the tracker)."
msgstr ""
"连接到每台飞行器的飞控和 Tracker，将 ``SYSID_THISMAV`` "
"设置为唯一数值（例如第一台飞行器设为「1」，第二台设为「2」，第三台设为「3」，Tracker 设为「9」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:51
#: 02fcef93da69430c9c50b5f27bc78e57 134cbbf76df74aa8bbb5335ec026af9e
#: 80de3705facd488a989552826b8cd934 b115dc02606d46caa2b79ed4274db78c
#: e8338dfd0a8143e88f895eeac32d4562
msgid ""
"On the GCS, :ref:`reduce data rate <planner:mission-planner-telemetry-logs-"
"setting-the-datarate>` to the minimum acceptable value to reduce network "
"traffic."
msgstr ""
"在 GCS 上，:ref:`将数据速率降至可接受的最低值 <planner:mission-planner-telemetry-logs-"
"setting-the-datarate>`，以减少网络流量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:53
#: 11ee431973214b898f69eb6c35410f96 6b8dbe95b23c4134b6caf387b00eb277
#: 9cae1a3506094a77b87c2a1712a0191b a49494ba8cbe41da9d6ac532e626b999
#: e408b343fbbc464eb1de95dcccccf6e7
msgid "Plug in the tracker to the ground station PC using a USB cable."
msgstr "使用 USB 线将 Tracker 连接到地面站电脑。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:56
#: 022ac44191ba4081afae701a2e5f4a38 0fa6a0280d5748aa8b4fd5b5ff6217f0
#: 271509d5b03248378c90a1bf7d6f5e57 2aa9cb29abbc4f18a69e0cb499684623
#: 4d252cf5ce344560907647c7a2ce4a5e
msgid "Controlling the vehicles"
msgstr "控制飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:58
#: 21963af6235349e68110f1e761bd08a0 243e24da2bd74663be83bb0a6c1276ff
#: 5337b3e2879244ccb22b473de84a784b 5f5d819a4a784cb58f1ddd99e5257131
#: dd007dbd7ed0455fa44bb9c2ab4147c8
msgid ""
"Plug in the battery of each vehicle and tracker.  After connecting to the "
"tracker from the *Mission Planner* (or other GCS) each vehicle including the"
" tracker should appear on the Map."
msgstr ""
"为每台飞行器和 Tracker 接上电池。从 *Mission Planner*（或其他 GCS）连接到 Tracker 后，包括 Tracker "
"在内的每台飞行器应出现在地图上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:62
#: 16b51d2cfda840e3997c4d96e4d4d358 1bd832a0b3b842f89d7f3dc48c055492
#: 3b9d859c8afa4abea5b459ac8c64c3dc 60d0266070e74b629d607240fc7ace4b
#: 713b6f384c414cb88c7cbd74052712de
msgid ""
"Controlling the vehicle depends upon the GCS used but if using the *Mission "
"Planner*, \"Ctrl-X\" pulls up a drop-down selector which allows the user to "
"choose which vehicle to control."
msgstr ""
"控制飞行器的方式取决于所用 GCS，如果使用 *Mission Planner*，按「Ctrl-X」会弹出下拉选择器，允许用户选择要控制哪台飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:66
#: 2da5a0e60fa8466a99713d4c5e270f0c 81578dc20ffa42f6906de1538c76e557
#: 842eaa7b86754607b51fecdf59a3c340 9f10ace32f364fe2944c4d6e9297e12f
#: a8ed492022b74ddab3e6158fce63e21b
msgid ""
"If using Copter, switch each vehicle into GUIDED mode.  On the MP's map, "
"right-mouse-button-click and select \"Takeoff\" and input 2m to get the "
"vehicle off the air.  Once in the air, each vehicle can be pushed around in "
"GUIDED mode (by using Ctrl-X to select the vehicle and then click on the "
"map) or the mode can be changed to AUTO etc."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 Copter，将每台飞行器切换到 Guided 模式。在 MP 地图上右键单击并选择「Takeoff」，输入 2m "
"使飞行器起飞。升空后，每台飞行器可以在 Guided 模式下推动（通过 Ctrl-X 选择飞行器后点击地图），或者将模式切换为 Auto 等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:72
#: 03676536df3848e795abf2cdf8d515fa 6696e30324bb4d54993c8bc210aeb845
#: 913ed7b7dced424e8e9e4a94e21fad69 a5948c41e5a243929a44f1d51c6764fd
#: fcfbf14dd8e64507b528de147e8c85b6
msgid ""
"If you wish to retake control of a vehicle, use the transmitter for that "
"vehicle to change the flight to LOITER, STABILIZE, etc and then fly "
"manually.  If only one transmitter is being used (not recommended) then use "
"the GCS to switch the single vehicle's mode to LOITER and then control with "
"the TX sticks (the other vehicles will ignore the TX's roll, pitch and "
"throttle input if they are in AUTO or GUIDED - they will accept yaw input "
"however)."
msgstr ""
"如果需要重新接管对某台飞行器的控制，使用该飞行器的遥控器将其切换到 Loiter、Stabilize "
"等模式，然后手动控制飞行。如果只使用一个遥控器（不推荐），则通过 GCS 将该飞行器的模式切换为 Loiter，然后用遥控器操控（处于 Auto 或 "
"Guided 模式的其他飞行器将忽略遥控器的横滚、俯仰和油门输入，但会接受偏航输入）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multi-vehicle-flying.rst:14
#: 0410c19ea911434e8d2a390aedd164a9 11af425a49624bc89be1e59ebbd648bb
#: 4ba5edbe86924f23b01abac3e312aaf1 b0b0b760f9c842b3ae760c1456bb7d8e
msgid ""
"This example has been greatly surpassed by `Michael Clement's 50 plane "
"demonstration <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/from-zero-to-fifty-"
"planes-in-twenty-seven-minutes>`__"
msgstr ""
"此示例已被 `Michael Clement 的 50 架飞机演示 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/from-zero-to-fifty-planes-in-twenty-"
"seven-minutes>`__ 大幅超越"
